doc/
# ...but `apps/etherlang/doc/README.md' is source, not a build artifact, and the
# `doc/' pattern above matches at any depth so it would swallow this too. It is
# what `make docs' output is *not*, which is the useful part of it.
!apps/etherlang/doc/
logs/
